      "title": "Work management",
      "summary": "The module brings projects, issues, boards, requests, and reports into one team workspace.",
      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Module access requires issue read permission. Individual changes may require additional permissions.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Choose Work management in the main menu, then open the required screen.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Start with the issue or project list. Open boards, requests, and reports from the module menu.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>You see only projects and issues included in your access scope.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>A missing item or action usually means that permission is missing or the feature is unavailable for that project.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/issues-list\">Issue list</a> and <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/permissions\">Permissions</a>.</p>\n",
