      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>The list requires issue read permission. Project changes require project management permission.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Choose Projects in Work management.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Filter by name, code, or kind. Open a row to navigate to the project page.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>You see the code, kind, lead, open issue count, and assigned schemes.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>An archived project can be hidden by the default filter and does not accept normal new work.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>See <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/project-detail\">Project configuration</a> and the <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/issues-list\">Issue list</a>.</p>\n",
