      "summary": "The project page controls its code, archive state, fields, issue types, workflow, and settings.",
      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Project management permission is required; scheme configuration may require an additional permission.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Open a project from the Projects list.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Choose a tab, change the setting, and confirm. Review the warning before archiving. Add custom fields with a data type and stable slot assignment.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>The configuration becomes the source of columns, filters, forms, and allowed transitions for the project.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>A field with values cannot be removed safely. Changing a project code affects new issue keys but must not invalidate old links.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>See <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/projects\">Projects</a> and <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/permissions\">Permissions</a>.</p>\n",
