      "title": "Cross-department requests",
      "summary": "The request view gathers work transferred between a requesting and a delivery department.",
      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Issue read permission and visibility of the relevant Intake projects are required.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Choose Requests in Work management.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Select a scope and intake project, apply filters, then open a request to inspect linked delivery work and delivery state.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>The list shows accessible requests with progress derived from linked delivery work.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>A link does not grant access to hidden issue content. Acceptance of a delivered result remains an explicit human decision.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>See <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/issue-detail\">Issue details</a> and <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/projects\">Projects</a>.</p>\n",
