      "title": "Hours report",
      "summary": "The report aggregates logged time by department, period, and work item, with a downloadable artifact when needed.",
      "html": "<h2>Who can perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Cross-project hours report permission is required.</p>\n<h2>Where to find the feature</h2>\n<p>Choose Hours report in Work management.</p>\n<h2>How to perform the operation</h2>\n<p>Select dates and filters, start generation, and monitor the run. Download the artifact when it is ready.</p>\n<h2>Result</h2>\n<p>The screen shows aggregated time while heavier work runs in the background without holding an HTTP request.</p>\n<h2>Limitations and special cases</h2>\n<p>The report does not expose issue titles that the recipient cannot access. A broad range can take longer to process.</p>\n<h2>Related topics</h2>\n<p>See <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/permissions\">Permissions</a> and <a href=\"/task-management/documentation/troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting</a>.</p>\n",
